Tibério Magno de Lima Alves. Eletromagnetismo Clássico, Volume I: Eletrostática, Editora IFRN. [Institutional catalogue and book](https://memoria.ifrn.edu.br/handle/1044/2475).

Read the complete Portuguese electrostatics volume, with the mathematical development and exercises, alongside the first advanced field study. Use it to write a Portuguese account of boundary conditions, potential and material response, then reconcile notation with the English books.

The publisher record identifies the author, title and issue date 11 August 2023. The 16,664,138-byte institutional PDF exceeded the automated reader limit on 29 October 2026; complete-page inspection and an open adaptation licence are not claimed. Inspect the actual book's notices before reuse. Repository hosting provides an authorized reading route, not a blanket permission to reproduce every component.

